{
  "type": "page",
  "title": "V-1 + V-2 联合验证",
  "body": [
    {
      "type": "service",
      "id": "pageStateService",
      "data": {
        "loadingA": false,
        "loadingB": false
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "alert",
          "level": "warning",
          "body": "<div style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.9'><b>操作流程：两步，别急</b><br/><b>第 1 步</b>　点下面 A / B / C 任意一个按钮 —— 它们<b>只负责打开弹层，不调接口</b><br/><b>第 2 步</b>　在弹层里点右下角的「<b>提交（调接口）</b>」按钮 —— <b>这一步才调接口</b>，延迟 2 秒<br/><br/><b>观察两点：</b><br/>① 弹层里那个「提交」按钮<b>转不转圈</b><br/>② 终端日志有没有<b>新增</b>一条 <code>GET /api/mock2/sample</code>（crud 刷新）<br/><br/>测完关掉弹层，再测下一组。</div>",
          "className": "mb-3"
        },
        {
          "type": "tpl",
          "tpl": "<div style='font-size:15px;padding:6px 0'>loadingA = <b>${loadingA}</b> ｜ loadingB = <b>${loadingB}</b></div>"
        },
        { "type": "divider" },
        {
          "type": "button",
          "label": "A：打开弹层（loadingOn + 置 true + api 带 reload）",
          "level": "primary",
          "className": "mb-2",
          "actionType": "dialog",
          "dialog": {
            "title": "A 组 - 修复方案",
            "actions": [
              { "type": "button", "label": "取消", "actionType": "close" },
              {
                "type": "button",
                "label": "提交（调接口）",
                "level": "primary",
                "actionType": "submit",
                "close": false,
                "loadingOn": "${loadingA}",
                "onEvent": {
                  "click": {
                    "actions": [
                      {
                        "actionType": "setValue",
                        "componentId": "pageStateService",
                        "args": { "value": { "loadingA": true } }
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "form",
              "body": [
                {
                  "type": "alert",
                  "level": "info",
                  "body": "点本弹层<b>右下角的「提交（调接口）」</b>，接口延迟 2 秒。<br/>观察这个按钮<b>是否转圈</b>，并看终端是否新增 crud 请求。"
                },
                { "type": "tpl", "tpl": "本组 api <b>带</b> <code>reload: mainCrud</code>" },
                { "type": "input-text", "name": "engine", "label": "Engine" }
              ],
              "onEvent": {
                "submitSucc": {
                  "actions": [
                    {
                      "actionType": "setValue",
                      "componentId": "pageStateService",
                      "args": { "value": { "loadingA": false } }
                    },
                    { "actionType": "closeDialog" }
                  ]
                },
                "submitFail": {
                  "actions": [
                    {
                      "actionType": "setValue",
                      "componentId": "pageStateService",
                      "args": { "value": { "loadingA": false } }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              "api": {
                "method": "post",
                "url": "/api/mock2/sample?waitSeconds=2",
                "reload": "mainCrud"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "button",
          "label": "B：打开弹层（loadingOn 但不置 true，skill 现状）",
          "level": "danger",
          "className": "mb-2 ml-2",
          "actionType": "dialog",
          "dialog": {
            "title": "B 组 - skill 现有写法",
            "actions": [
              { "type": "button", "label": "取消", "actionType": "close" },
              {
                "type": "button",
                "label": "提交（调接口）",
                "level": "primary",
                "actionType": "submit",
                "close": false,
                "loadingOn": "${loadingB}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "form",
              "body": [
                {
                  "type": "alert",
                  "level": "info",
                  "body": "同样点<b>右下角「提交（调接口）」</b>。<br/>本组 <code>loadingB</code> 从未置 true，<b>预期不转圈</b> —— 这就是 P0-1 要证实的 bug。"
                },
                { "type": "tpl", "tpl": "本组 api <b>不带</b> reload" },
                { "type": "input-text", "name": "engine", "label": "Engine" }
              ],
              "onEvent": {
                "submitSucc": {
                  "actions": [
                    {
                      "actionType": "setValue",
                      "componentId": "pageStateService",
                      "args": { "value": { "loadingB": false } }
                    },
                    { "actionType": "closeDialog" }
                  ]
                },
                "submitFail": {
                  "actions": [
                    {
                      "actionType": "setValue",
                      "componentId": "pageStateService",
                      "args": { "value": { "loadingB": false } }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              "api": {
                "method": "post",
                "url": "/api/mock2/sample?waitSeconds=2"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "button",
          "label": "C：打开弹层（不带 loadingOn，看内建 loading）",
          "className": "mb-2 ml-2",
          "actionType": "dialog",
          "dialog": {
            "title": "C 组 - 对照组",
            "actions": [
              { "type": "button", "label": "取消", "actionType": "close" },
              {
                "type": "button",
                "label": "提交（调接口）",
                "level": "primary",
                "actionType": "submit",
                "close": false
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "form",
              "body": [
                {
                  "type": "alert",
                  "level": "info",
                  "body": "点<b>右下角「提交（调接口）」</b>。<br/>本组完全不带 <code>loadingOn</code>，看 amis <b>是否自带 loading</b>。"
                },
                { "type": "input-text", "name": "engine", "label": "Engine" }
              ],
              "onEvent": {
                "submitSucc": {
                  "actions": [{ "actionType": "closeDialog" }]
                }
              },
              "api": {
                "method": "post",
                "url": "/api/mock2/sample?waitSeconds=2"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "button",
          "label": "D：打开弹层（接口失败，看 loading 会不会卡死）",
          "level": "danger",
          "className": "mb-2 ml-2",
          "actionType": "dialog",
          "dialog": {
            "title": "D 组 - 失败场景",
            "actions": [
              { "type": "button", "label": "取消", "actionType": "close" },
              {
                "type": "button",
                "label": "提交（会失败）",
                "level": "danger",
                "actionType": "submit",
                "close": false
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "form",
              "body": [
                {
                  "type": "alert",
                  "level": "warning",
                  "body": "点右下角「<b>提交（会失败）</b>」，接口会返回 <code>status=1</code>。<br/><br/>观察三点：<br/>① 2 秒后 loading <b>消不消失</b><br/>② 弹层<b>是否保持打开</b>（submitFail 不关）<br/>③ 能否<b>再点一次</b>提交（这才是「失败可重试」的关键）"
                },
                { "type": "input-text", "name": "engine", "label": "Engine" }
              ],
              "onEvent": {
                "submitFail": {
                  "actions": [
                    {
                      "actionType": "toast",
                      "args": { "msg": "提交失败：弹层保持打开，loading 应已消失，可以再点一次" }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              "api": {
                "method": "post",
                "url": "/api/mock2/sample?waitSeconds=2&fail=1"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        { "type": "divider" },
        {
          "type": "tpl",
          "tpl": "<div style='color:#999;margin-bottom:8px'>下面是 mainCrud（id 和 name 都是 mainCrud）。它的每次请求都会打印到终端，这是判断 V-2 的唯一依据。</div>"
        },
        {
          "type": "crud",
          "id": "mainCrud",
          "name": "mainCrud",
          "syncLocation": false,
          "perPageAvailable": [10, 20],
          "api": "/api/mock2/sample",
          "columns": [
            { "name": "id", "label": "ID" },
            { "name": "engine", "label": "Engine" },
            { "name": "browser", "label": "Browser" },
            { "name": "version", "label": "Version" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
